Resort Gorgeous is a location north of the [[Water Labyrinth]] in the [[Sevii Islands]]. This location originally appeared in Pokémon Fire Red and Leaf Green. 

Selphy, a wealthy Pokémon Trainer, permanently resides in the resort. She asks the player to show her a fusion between two Pokémon. The fusion she wants to see is random and it changes every in-game day. If the player shows her the fusion she requested, she will give the player a reward. 
<br />

==Rewards==
[[File:Resort Gorgeous.png|thumb|510x370px]]
The first time the player shows her a fusion, she will give him the Master Ball she has on her table. She will give another Master Ball every 10 times and Rare Candies the rest of the time. The number of Rare Candies she gives after being shown a fusion increases every 10 times and so on. There is no limit to the number of Rare Candies and Master Balls than can be obtained.
